      "id": "0001",
      "front": "What form does the decomposition of $\\frac{5x - 4}{(x - 2)(x + 1)}$ take?",
      "back": "$\\frac{A}{x - 2} + \\frac{B}{x + 1}$",
      "answerType": "EXPRESSION",
      "keyPoints": [
        {
          "text": "a constant over each distinct linear factor",
          "synonyms": [
            "A/(x-2) + B/(x+1)"
